  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A possible fission reaction is:</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"_{0}^{1}\\textrm{n} + _{\\; \\, 92}^{235}\\textrm{U} \\: \\rightarrow \\:{}  _{\\, \\; 56}^{144}\\textrm{Ba} + _{36}^{89}\\textrm{Kr} + 3\\,{} _{0}^{1}\\textrm{n}\"></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>What is true about the nuclear binding energy per nucleon for uranium-235 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"(b_{\\textup{U}})\"></span>, barium-144 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"(b_{\\textup{Ba}})\"></span>, and krypton-89 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"(b_{\\textup{Kr}})\"></span>? </p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"b_{\\textup{U}}&gt;b_{\\textup{Ba}}&gt;b_{\\textup{Kr}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"b_{\\textup{U}}&gt;b_{\\textup{Kr}}&gt;b_{\\textup{Ba}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"b_{\\textup{Kr}}&gt;b_{\\textup{U}}&gt;b_{\\textup{Ba}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"b_{\\textup{Kr}}&gt;b_{\\textup{Ba}}&gt;b_{\\textup{U}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
